            "review_title": "Review at Soma Art Cafe",
            "review_text": "Menekag\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1948 contributions\n0\nGreat place for tasty brunch.\nSep 2023 • Friends\nSuper cafe for brunch or lunch in Thao Dien. It didn't have a cosy vibe but perfect to catch up with friends or even if you need a place to do some work. There is outdoor seating as well as indoor seating. We were a group of 5 so opted for a long table inside. We did feel a tad rushed as they needed the table to setup for an event that afternoon.\n\nThat being said the food and service made up for it. \n\nI ordered a lamb bowl which was massive and delicious. Portions were very generous and food served was fresh and delicious. Perfect if you are looking for something healthy and fulfilling.\nThe only downer was my dirty macha latte. May have been my fault as the name itself wasn't too appetising.\nRead more\nWritten October 8, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
