            "review_text": "Louis Nguyen\nAsia45 contributions\n0\nExtremely disappointed about this restaurant. Please don’t come here!\nJun 2019 • Friends\nI came to this restaurant with my friends for lunch, extremely disappointed about this place. We ordered the food and it took them 45mins to done the food as you see in the photo, have to say that the restaurant almost completely empty as you see the photo here as well. I can’t believe in super slow service here. \nPlease never visit this place, they don’t care about you at all and unacceptable for a simple food takes 45mins. \nNever go back here again and will tell all of my friends never come here as well.\nRead more\nWritten June 9, 2019",
